Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 803 "[Crack of All Means] Deliver it carefully."
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of the [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Harrigan."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of the [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Marcus."
    Collect 1 of 900333000

Requires player level >= 58 and quest 802 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Bring [Mana remains sample] to Herga."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Bring [Mana remains sample] to Nez."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Did you visit him? What did he say?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Mana remains sample]? Hm...\n\nDeliver [Mana remains sample] to Luferson Castle's [Advisor] Herga following Harrigon's request."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Ah you came back! What did he say?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Mana remains sample]? Hm...\n\nDeliver [Mana remains sample] to El Morad Castle's [Advisor] Nez following Marcus's request."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "So where is it?"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "So where is this [Mana remains sample]?"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "OH no...\n\nI'll need to analyze this. Talk to me again a bit later."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "oh no...\n\nI'll need to analyze this. Talk to me again a bit later."
